        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We deliver a seamless Member experience through our mobile application, offering products designed to address the most critical financial needs of our Members: instant and affordable access to credit, fee-free banking, and financial management tools.",
